Some events exist on Resend https://resend.com/docs/webhooks/event-types but are absent from `ResendPayloadConverter`:

- `email.received`
- `email.scheduled`
- `email.suppressed`

These could trigger `Unsupported event: …`. The current workaround is to disable these wehbooks in Resend's UI.

